  <name>Ultra System Monitor</name>
  <summary>Real-time system monitoring sidebar</summary>
  <developer id="bd.aicms"><name>AiCMS.BD</name></developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Free real-time system monitoring sidebar: per-core CPU load and temperature,
      GPU statistics, RAM, motherboard sensors, network speeds with live graphs,
      storage capacity and security health. Detach any section as a floating widget
      with card or analog speedometer gauge view. 3D glassmorphism themes, custom
      accent colors, English and Bangla. No ads, no tracking, no telemetry.
    </p>
  </description>
